  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A big climb still leaves ground to cover",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-19-1003-arc-2-flying-pandas-climbs-to-twenty-fourth"
      ],
      "text": "Flying Pandas adds 12.91 points against the previous close, reaching 54.58 and climbing from 43rd to 24th. It is the largest verified net score gain among the edition’s selected movers, but remains 10.14 points short of the provisional gold boundary. Tufa Labs leads at 88.06, Yi-Chia Chen is second at 84.72 and rabbithole third at 80.56. nvbanana holds fourth at 79.17. Tufa’s score is unchanged; Chen’s previous-close comparison is unavailable."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Gold moves away from the morning arrival",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-19-0800-arc-2-okiek-enters-gold-as-artificial-agency-lab-slips-out"
      ],
      "text": "okiek closes 17th at 63.47, nine places and 10.83 points ahead of the previous close. The morning wire recorded a genuine arrival in the gold band at 16th; by the close, the boundary stands at 64.72 and okiek sits 1.25 points below it. artificialagencylab.com has also improved, adding 2.50 points to 65.56 and closing 15th, back above the line. ARCward Intelligence gains 2.36 points to 60.69 but falls two places to 20th. Public medal positions remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Jack Cole joins a separate ARC2 squad",
      "sourceIds": [
        "person-jack-cole-identity-0",
        "dispatch-2026-10-19-special-afternoon-jack-cole-arc-mutants",
        "social-2112247067913457944",
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-19-1003-arc-2-team-turducken-surges-to-fifty-fifth"
      ],
      "text": "Jack Cole joins Mark Barney, Son Pham and Ronen in ARC Mutants, whose closing roster lists jcole75, markbarney, scizical and sonphamorg. The commissioned feature above preserves the announcement and Mark’s stated ambition to reach gold. ARC Mutants closes 56th at 39.31; its previous-close comparison is unknown. The wire earlier reported this same ARC2 entry under its former Team Turducken name, with a different comparison window. Team Turducken on ARC3 is a separate entry with a separate roster and result; Cole’s ARC2 arrival does not add him to that team."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The chase reaches beyond the medal line",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-19-1201-arc-2-nguyenthanhnan-climbs-to-twenty-eighth",
        "wire-2026-10-19-1600-arc-2-eshaan-mistry-climbs-to-seventy-second"
      ],
      "text": "NguyenThanhNhan gains 10.83 points and closes 28th at 52.08; Yanming (Owen) Dong adds 10.00 points to finish 29th at 51.25. Eshaan Mistry gains 49 places against the previous close and finishes 73rd at 36.39, one place below the afternoon wire observation. ARC Raiders closes 11th at an unchanged 68.33, while Mithil A Vakde is 91st at an unchanged 33.89. Stronger scores elsewhere can move a team down even when its own result holds."
    }
